  # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  # 2. Strong-lensing population parameters: LensPop
  # ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - type: software
    title: "LensPop"
    authors:
      - family-names: Collett
        given-names: Thomas E.
    repository-code: "https://github.com/tcollett/LensPop"
    notes: >-
      The author asks users to cite Collett (2015) and to email
      thomas.collett@port.ac.uk to say they are using the code.

  - type: article
    title: "The population of galaxy-galaxy strong lenses in forthcoming optical imaging surveys"
    authors:
      - family-names: Collett
        given-names: Thomas E.
    year: 2015
    journal: "The Astrophysical Journal"
    volume: 811
    issue: 1
    start: 20
    doi: 10.1088/0004-637X/811/1/20
    identifiers:
      - type: other
        value: "arXiv:1507.02657"

